          scope: T('综合性化学学术期刊，稿件以中文为主；英文稿件须先投国际顶级化学期刊并获得正面评价，再经主编同意方可发表。计算类稿件除达到普通研究论文的水平外还须：所用理论和方法足以解决所研究的问题；计算结果与实验现象、已有实验数据有较好的相关性；有深刻的化学见解和实质性的预测价值。',
            'A general chemistry journal publishing mainly in Chinese; English manuscripts are accepted only with the editor-in-chief\'s approval after positive reviews at a top international journal. Computational papers must also use theory and methods adequate for the question, agree well with experimental observations and available data, and offer real chemical insight and predictive value.', ['guide']),
